      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, this entire rabbit hole was motivated by the HighContrastFilter, which does\n\n```\n                \"if (grayscale \u003d\u003d 1) {\"\n                    \"c.rgb \u003d dot(half3(0.2126, 0.7152, 0.0722), c.rgb).rrr;\"\n                \"}\"\n                \"if (invertStyle \u003d\u003d 1) {\"  // brightness\n                    \"c.rgb \u003d 1 - c.rgb;\"\n                \"} else if (invertStyle \u003d\u003d 2) {\"  // lightness\n                    \"c.rgb \u003d rgb_to_hsl(c.rgb);\"\n                    \"c.b \u003d 1 - c.b;\"\n                    \"c.rgb \u003d $hsl_to_rgb(c.rgb);\"\n                \"}\"\n```\n\nAnd I wanted to focus on optimizing those checks.\nAlso, I figure I can use the branch op when implementing `switch`. We don\u0027t want `switch` on a uniform to evaluate every `case`.",
